== Trivia ==
* In earlier versions of ''Repentance'', this item used to kill any characters with red hearts when used while they were turned into {{c|The Lost}}.
* The description on this item matches the name of the item {{I|A Pound of Flesh}}.
* The pickup quote "A pound of flesh" is a reference to Shakespeare's ''[[wikipedia:The Merchant of Venice|The Merchant of Venice]]''.
* This item might be a reference of the infamous suicide of Petunia from Happy Tree Friends' episode [https://youtu.be/-8ZjTWvrkbQ Wishy Washy] (content warning: extreme cartoon gore).

